{"unit_id":"tag:04W4:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003> 是 <MATH_0004> 上具有固定目标的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射族（families of morphisms）。设 <MATH_0005> 是具有固定目标的映射（maps）族的态射（morphism），见《位点（Sites）》定义 <REF_0001>。设 <MATH_0006> 是关于族 <MATH_0007> 的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的下降（descent）资料。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 系统 <MATH_0008> 是关于族 <MATH_0009> 的下降（descent）资料。\n<STRUCT_0003> 这一构造关于下降（descent）资料 <MATH_0010> 是函子性的。\n<STRUCT_0004> 给定具有固定目标的映射（maps）族的第二个态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>，满足 <MATH_0012>，存在下降（descent）资料的函子性同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"本包词表未批准此术语。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"本包词表未批准此术语。"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"具有固定目标的族。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"族中的映射。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"族之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"所引用章名。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"下降对象。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降资料。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"函子性同构。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04W4:proof","translation":"略去。提示：映射（maps）<MATH_0001> 给出第 (3) 项中下降（descent）资料的同构（isomorphism）；它们是映射（maps）<MATH_0002> 沿态射（morphisms）<MATH_0003> 的拉回（pullbacks）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"提示中的映射。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降资料。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"第(3)项的同构。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"沿其拉回。"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回","context":"提示中的构造。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04W2:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。上面的引理告诉我们，只要这两个映射（maps）族之间存在一个“位于 <MATH_0004> 之上”的态射（morphism），就有一个良定义的拉回（pullback）函子（functor），其作用在关于目标为 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003> 的映射（maps）族的下降（descent）资料的范畴（categories）之间。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定态射的对象。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"空间及映射族的态射。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"具有固定目标的族。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"下降资料的拉回。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"上述构造。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降资料。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"下降资料所在范畴。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04W5:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上具有固定目标的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射族（family of morphisms）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设 <MATH_0004> 是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的 <MATH_0005>-模（module）。我们把 <MATH_0006> 上关于覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007> 的唯一下降（descent）资料称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>平凡下降资料（trivial descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 平凡下降资料（trivial descent datum）到 <MATH_0008> 的拉回（pullback）称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>典范下降资料（canonical descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。记号：<MATH_0009>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 关于给定族的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的下降（descent）资料 <MATH_0010> 称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0003>有效的（effective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，如果存在 <MATH_0012> 上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0011>，使得 <MATH_0013> 同构（isomorphic）于 <MATH_0014>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降资料"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降资料"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降资料"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底概形。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射族中的对象。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"固定目标的族。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"所讨论的模。"},{"source_term":"module","tar