{"unit_id":"tag:04W6:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。设 <MATH_0004> 是 <MATH_0005> 的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），见《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》定义 <REF_0001>。关于族 <MATH_0006> 的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的任何下降（descent）资料都是有效的。此外，从拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0007>-模（modules）的范畴（category）到关于 <MATH_0008> 的下降（descent）资料的范畴（category）的函子（functor）是全忠实的（fully faithful）。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖的目标。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"覆盖类型。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章名。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"下降对象。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"资料。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"模的性质。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"范畴中的对象。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"函子的两端。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"本陈述中的函子。"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的","context":"函子性质。"}],"notes":[]}
