{"unit_id":"tag:04W7:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n模（modules）的平坦（flat）下降（descent）的主要应用，是拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）关于 fpqc-覆盖（coverings）的相应下降（descent）陈述。\n\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"平坦下降的对象。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"下降的类型。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"本节主题。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"相应的对象。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"fpqc覆盖。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04W8:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），见《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》定义 <REF_0001>。关于 <MATH_0004> 的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的任何下降（descent）资料都是有效的。此外，从拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0005>-模（modules）的范畴（category）到关于 <MATH_0006> 的下降（descent）资料的范畴（category）的函子（functor）是全忠实的（fully faithful）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖族。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"覆盖类型。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章名。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"下降对象。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"资料。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"模的性质。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"范畴对象。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"函子两端。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"本陈述的函子。"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的","context":"函子性质。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04W8:proof","translation":"这或多或少是概形（schemes）的相应结果的形式推论，见《下降（Descent）》命题 <REF_0001>。下面给出证明的一种策略：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 由 <MATH_0001> 是平凡覆盖（covering）<MATH_0002> 的加细这一事实，通过引理 <REF_0002>，得到一个函子（functor）<MATH_0003>，从拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>-模（modules）的范畴（category）到给定族的下降（descent）资料的范畴（category）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 为了证明此命题，我们将构造一个拟逆（quasi-inverse）函子（functor）<MATH_0005>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 再次应用引理 <REF_0003>，我们看到，若 <MATH_0007> 是给定族的加细，则存在函子（functor）<MATH_0006>。因此，为构造函子（functor）<MATH_0008>，我们可以假设每个 <MATH_0009> 都是概形（scheme），见《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0004>。这使我们归结到所有 <MATH_0010> 都是概形（schemes）的情形。\n<STRUCT_0005> 按定义，<MATH_0011> 上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）是 <MATH_0013> 上的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0012>-模（module）。现在，对任意 <MATH_0014>，我们得到由概形（schemes）组成的 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0015>，以及位于 <MATH_0017> 之上的覆盖（coverings）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0016>。给定下降（descent）资料 <MATH_0018>，我们得到拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0019>-模（module）<MATH_0020>，它对应于引理 <REF_0005> 中到 <MATH_0022> 的覆盖（covering）的拉回（pullback）<MATH_0021>，这里使用了概形（schemes）的 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）的有效性，见《下降（Descent）》命题 <REF_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0006> 检查 <MATH_0023> 关于 <MATH_0024> 是函子性的。略去。\n<STRUCT_0007> 检查 <MATH_0025> 与位点（site）<MATH_0027> 的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0026> 相容，从而层（sheaves）的系统 <MATH_0028> 对应于 <MATH_0030> 上的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0029>，见《代数空间的性质》引理 <REF_0007>。细节略去。\n<STRUCT_0008> 检查 <MATH_0031> 是第 (1) 项中构造的函子（functor）的拟逆（quasi-inverse）。略去。\n<STRUCT_0009>\n证明完成。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"对应的已知结果。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"证明中的覆盖。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"证明中构造的函子。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"模的性质。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"范畴的对象。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"函子两端。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降资料。"},{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆","context":"证明的构造。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"加细后的成员。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章名。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent 