{"unit_id":"tag:0H02:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。回忆 <MATH_0004> 是 <MATH_0005> 的全子范畴（full subcategory），其对象（objects）是仿射的（affine）；通过声明覆盖（coverings）为标准平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（coverings），将其变为位点（site）。见《代数空间的性质》定义 <REF_0001>。由《代数空间的性质》引理 <REF_0002>，我们有拓扑斯的等价（equivalence）<MATH_0006>，其拉回（pullback）函子（functor）由限制给出。回忆 <MATH_0007> 表示 <MATH_0008> 上的结构层（structure sheaf）。于是我们得到赋环拓扑斯的等价（equivalence）<MATH_0009>。我们常把 <MATH_0010> 写成 <MATH_0011> 的替代记号。有了这些说明，我们也可以比较拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent modules）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"structure sheaf","target_term":"结构层"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent modules","target_term":"拟凝聚模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定空间。"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴","context":"仿射对象的范畴。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"全子范畴的对象。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"对象性质。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"位点的覆盖。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"标准覆盖的类型。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"范畴上的位点结构。"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"拓扑斯之间的等价。"},{"