{"unit_id":"tag:0H04:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。设 <MATH_0004> 是 <MATH_0006> 上的 <MATH_0005>-模（modules）的预层（presheaf）。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对 <MATH_0008> 的每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，映射（map）<MATH_0009> 都是同构（isomorphism），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0010> 是赋环位点（ringed site）<MATH_0011> 上的拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent module），其含义见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》定义 <REF_0001>，\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0012> 通过等价（equivalence）（<REF_0002>）对应于 <MATH_0013> 上的拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent module），\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent module","target_term":"拟凝聚模"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent module","target_term":"拟凝聚模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"所讨论的空间。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"预层的值。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"给定对象。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"三个条件的关系。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"第(1)项。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"第(1)项。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"第(1)项性质。"},{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"第(2)项所在位点。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent module","target_term":"拟凝聚模","context":"第(2)(3)项的对象。"},{"source_term":"Modules on Site