{"unit_id":"tag:060T:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节是《下降（Descent）》第 <REF_0001> 节在代数空间（algebraic spaces）情形下的对应版本。目标是说明，可以通过检查覆盖（covering）的各成员来检查拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent module）是否满足某些有限性条件。我们将反复使用以下证明方案（scheme）。假设 <MATH_0001> 是代数空间（algebraic space），<MATH_0002> 是 fppf（相应地，<SPACE_0001>fpqc）覆盖（covering）。设 <MATH_0003> 是满射的（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism），使得 <MATH_0004> 是概形（scheme）。则存在 fppf（相应地，<SPACE_0002>fpqc）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0006> 是 <MATH_0007> 的加细，\n<STRUCT_0004> 每个 <MATH_0008> 都是概形（scheme），且\n<STRUCT_0005> 每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0009> 都经过 <MATH_0010> 分解，且\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0011> 是 <MATH_0012> 的 fppf（相应地，<SPACE_0003>fpqc）覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n具体而言，先用一个每个 <MATH_0014> 都是概形（scheme）的 fppf（相应地，<SPACE_0004>fpqc）覆盖（covering）加细 <MATH_0013>，见《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0002>，相应地，<SPACE_0005>引理 <REF_0003>。然后令 <MATH_0015>。拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0016>-模（module）<MATH_0017> 是有限型的（finite type）、有限表示的（finite presentation）等等，当且仅当拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0018>-模（module）<MATH_0019> 是有限型的（finite type）、有限表示的（finite presentation）等等。因此，可以利用加细 <MATH_0020> 的存在，将以下引理的证明归结到概形（schemes）的情形。我们将用“<TEXTITOPEN_0001>结果通过平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）局部化（localization）由概形（schemes）的情形得出<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>”这一表述来表示这一点。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf","fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent module","target_term":"拟凝聚模"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"方案"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型的"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示的"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型的"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示的"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"本节的对象。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"下降的覆盖。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent module","target_term":"拟凝聚模","context":"待检查的模。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"方案","context":"proof scheme为普通证明方案，非概形。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定空间。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"所选态射的性质。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"所选态射的性质。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所选及加细中的态射。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"加细后的成员。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章名。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"模的性质。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"待检查的对象。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型的","context":"待下降的有限性性质。"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示的","context":"待下降的有限性性质。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"归结后的情形。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","tar